      "HDBaseT/RJ45 colour box, HDMI 1-4, USB-A (DEVICE 1-5, rear), USB-C (DEVICE 6 rear; USB-C1/2 front; SERVICE rear): estimated from supplier silkprint drawing V1.2, not signed off.",
